}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"796d09eb-bdd1-4a91-87a3-ab6487fe41cb"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Surface-like graphs", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"264a07a5-072b-4ab7-80a6-a96f7c845788"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["TessellationCurvature",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the combinatorial Gaussian curvature at a vertex of a regular \
or uniform map; its sign says spherical, flat or hyperbolic"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"8de21532-71d5-4d8e-a037-c47db20584eb"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["TessellationEulerCharacteristic",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the Euler characteristic V - E + F of a tessellation graph"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"d729c44a-4cb5-4ac0-b8cc-aac237d4b7e7"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["TessellationGenus",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
 " \[LongDash] the orientable genus of a tessellation graph, from its Euler \
characteristic"
}], "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"60ff7a38-5630-49d5-972f-aa9ce86b5919"],

Cell["\<\
waits: a test whether a graph is surface-like at a scale, its metric balls \
discs and its metric shells cycles\
\>", "GuideText",ExpressionUUID->"638112a5-766d-42b5-b0c9-392e9eb17635"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Preparing a substrate", "GuideFunctionsSubsection",ExpressionUUID->"15f451ac-df60-4c40-a385-dca63a1c97e4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 StyleBox["CenterGraph",
  FontWeight->"Bold"],
